{
  "bodyHash": "BGNQp58nZTY=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">樹木收割機是一個可設定的模組，允許你透過砍伐一個基礎方塊來瞬間收穫樹木、扭曲樹木和巨型蘑菇。這可以是樹的任何部分。樹苗會根據樹木掉落的物品自動被種植。模組內有許多檢查機制，從防止意外砍伐由原木建造的房屋，到決定哪些樹葉應該消失。<br><br>預設情況下，收穫功能僅在按住蹲下按鈕時運作，但你可以在設定中切換此行為。更多功能範例請見下方。有許多設定選項可供你根據喜好微調模組。<br><br>此模組是與我的<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ore-harvester\" rel=\"nofollow\">礦石收割機</a>模組一同開發的。</span><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>預設設定下的功能：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>所有樹木，無論是原版還是模組新增的，都可以透過蹲下並砍伐一個方塊來快速收穫。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>砍伐一棵樹所需的時間取決於樹木中包含的原木數量。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>收穫樹木後，樹葉會非常快速地消失。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>最後一片樹葉消失後，樹苗會自動被種植。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>地獄中的扭曲樹木可以快速收穫。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>巨型蘑菇也可以快速收穫<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>可以透過黑名單將特定類型的斧頭排除在樹木收穫之外。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>有許多檢查機制來判斷什麼是樹木、什麼不是。不會意外破壞房屋。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>當兩種不同類型的樹木相鄰時，只有被砍伐的樹木的葉子會消失。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>與其他模組相容。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum 的生活品質組合包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHoldAxeForTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，樹木收穫僅在玩家主要手持斧頭時運作。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>treeHarvestWithoutSneak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，未按住蹲下按鈕時也能進行樹木收穫。若停用則相反，僅在蹲下時運作。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>automaticallyFindBottomBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否讓模組嘗試找到樹木實際的最底部原木並從那裡開始。這意味著你可以砍伐樹木的中間部分，它仍然會完全倒下。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFastLeafDecay</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，被砍伐樹木周圍的樹葉會快速消失。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableNetherTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，地獄中的扭曲蕈/緋紅蕈樹也會被快速砍伐。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableHugeMushrooms</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，巨大/巨型蘑菇也會被快速砍伐。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ignorePlayerMadeTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，玩家放置樹葉的樹木不會被破壞。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceSaplingOnTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，收穫樹木後會自動從掉落物中種植樹苗。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceMushroomOnMushroomHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，且在收穫巨型蘑菇時啟用了 'enableHugeMushrooms'，則會自動從掉落物中種植蘑菇。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，每收穫一塊原木，手持的斧頭就會消耗耐久度。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 1.0，最小值 0.001，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">你可以在此設定砍伐一棵樹應該消耗斧頭多少耐久度。例如，設定為 0.1 時，代表每 10 塊原木消耗 1 點耐久度。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，玩家每收穫一塊原木，疲勞度會增加 0.005 (Minecraft 預設每破壞一個方塊的疲勞值) * increaseExhaustionModifier。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 1.0，最小值 0.001，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">這決定了每收穫一塊原木應為玩家增加多少疲勞度。預設為 0.005 * 1.0。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseHarvestingTimePerLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，收穫時間會根據樹木中現有的原木數量而增加。增加幅度由 'increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier' 決定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 0.1，最小值 0.01，最大值 10.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用 'increaseHarvestingTimePerLog' 後，收穫一棵樹需要花費多長時間。實際速度為：newSpeed = originalSpeed / (1 + (logCount * increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier))。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>amountOfLeavesBrokenPerTick</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 3，最小值 1，最大值 16</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">樹木被收穫後，每遊戲刻應破壞多少片樹葉。增加此值會加速樹葉快速消失，但每個遊戲刻需要更多的處理能力。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>斧頭黑名單功能：</strong></span><br>可以設定僅允許特定斧頭收穫樹木。在首次載入模組時，會生成一個黑名單檔案。它位於 <strong><em>./config/treeharvester/harvestable_axe_blacklist.txt</em></strong>。這也適用於模組新增的斧頭物品。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/blacklist.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>收穫一棵與橡樹相鄰的白樺樹。只有白樺樹的葉子在消失：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/birch_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵大橡樹：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_oak_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵 2x2 雲杉樹。砍伐樹木所需的時間較長，且所有 4 棵樹苗都會被正確種植：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_spruce.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>適用於扭曲（地獄）樹木：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/nether_tree.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>也適用於巨型蘑菇，這裡是棕色蘑菇：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/brown_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>以及紅色蘑菇：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/red_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，前提是下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統中。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽和更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或任何其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
